- $\sum_{j=1}^{200} j = \frac{200 \cdot 201}{2} = 20,100$

So: $\frac{1}{2}(2,686,700 - 20,100) = \frac{1}{2}(2,666,600) = 1,333,300$

Average: $\frac{1,333,300}{19,900} = 67$

Total expected value: $100 \times 67 = 6700$

